      "content": "Hey, I need to send an email to all the tenants in our Shinjuku high-rise building. We've got routine HVAC maintenance scheduled for this coming weekend, so the temperature in the offices is gonna fluctuate a bit while they work on it. Can you draft a formal notice for us? Make it sound professional and apologetic for the inconvenience.",
